# Optional settings. Copy to .env (cp .env.example .env), uncomment what you need, then restart Helm.
# 全部可选。复制成 .env（cp .env.example .env），去掉需要那行前面的 #，然后重启 Helm。
# All settings: docs/CONFIGURATION.md
# PORT=4377
# CLAUDE_BIN=/Users/you/.local/bin/claude
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# CLAUDE_EFFORT=medium
# DOTNET_BIN=/Users/you/.dotnet/dotnet
# QS_PYTHON=/Users/you/path/to/python-with-qlib
